      "writtenOn": "2026-05-29T12:50:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In gunyah, RM(EL1) is the privileged host-side manager for VM resources, while EL2(Hyp) Act as enforcement layer, So there is a trust contract between the two. Not covered here neither part of this patch",
